    {"en", "copyid [ <keyfile> ]\n  Installs the public key of the private key in use (or of\n  <keyfile>) into ~/.ssh/authorized_keys on the server, so\n  that later connections need no password. Requires a SFTP\n  or SCP session and a key this build can read.", "copyid [ <keyfile> ]\n  Installs the public key of the private key in use (or of\n  <keyfile>) into ~/.ssh/authorized_keys on the server, so\n  that later connections need no password. Requires a SFTP\n  or SCP session and a key this build can read."},
    {"en", "cp <source> [ <source>... ] <target>\n  Copies files on the server, server-side when it can,\n  streamed through this client otherwise.", "cp <source> [ <source>... ] <target>\n  Copies files on the server, server-side when it can,\n  streamed through this client otherwise."},
