    {"en", "keepuptodate [ <localdir> [ <remotedir> ] ]\n  Reflects local changes on the remote side, watching the local\n  tree with inotify. -interval=<seconds>, -count=<passes>,\n  -delete, -continue, -filemask=, -transfer=.", "keepuptodate [ <localdir> [ <remotedir> ] ]\n  Reflects local changes on the remote side, watching the local\n  tree with inotify. -interval=<seconds>, -count=<passes>,\n  -delete, -continue, -filemask=, -transfer=."},
